			<div class="content">
				<h5 style="text-align:center;">Camp Empowers Our Future</h5>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Summer camp is an amazing opportunity for children of all ages to learn new skills, develop their physical and mental capabilities, and make new friends. Kids become more resilient from their camp experiences, as it helps them better handle life's stress.
				</p>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Camps also provide an invaluable break from screens which allows kids to engage in meaningful outdoor activities and gain valuable life skills, like fire safety or gardening. Teamwork and socialization are fostered through various activities at camp, preparing young ones for success later on in life.
				</p>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Along with practical skills, education and love for the arts are also fostered at camps through musical and visual arts classes.
				</p>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://give.salvationarmyalm.org/give/176800/#!/donation/checkout?c_src=glab&amp;c_src2=EmpowerOurFuture" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2">Sponsor a Child</a></p>
